from the structural perspective, a Car is made of an Engine, the Transmission, and a Chassis !
the Transmission can be an Automatic or a Manual in gearShift!
Engine can be ElectricEngine, GasolineEngine or NaturalGasEngine in engineType!
from the structural perspective, Engine sends Rotation to Transmission!
from the structural perspective, Transmission sends Motion to Chassis!
Engine has HoursRun and Pressure!
the range of Engine's HoursRun is number with values [0, 100000]!
the range of Engine's Pressure is number with values (-6.3, 6.3]!
Transmission has GearType!
the range of Transmission's GearType is string with values Automatic, Manual and CVT!
